      "translation": "One evening, a princess woke up. “It’s time for the ball!”",
      "translations": [
        "One evening, a princess woke up. “It’s time for the ball!”",
        "She went to the castle. It was dark. Where was the door?",
        "The princess turned on her little light. “I found it!” She walked up the steps and opened the door.",
        "She heard lovely music. The princess smiled and began to dance!"
